/* ==============================================================================
   HOW TO ADD A NEW MONTH (e.g. April 2026)
   ==============================================================================

   1) MONTHLY P&L (window.MONTHS array)
      - Open this file in any text editor
      - Find the last entry (mar26) in the MONTHS array
      - Copy the entire { ... } block including the comma after the closing brace
      - Paste it after the mar26 entry
      - Update: key, label, short, ym, all numeric values
      - Save the file

   2) DAILY POS DATA (window.DAILY array)
      - This array contains one entry per business day
      - Each entry: {date, dow, invoices, card_sales, cash_close, var_cash, var_card, shifts}
      - Append new daily entries from your PetPooja Day-End reports

   3) CATEGORY DATA (window.CAT_DATA object)
      - Keyed by year-month (e.g. "2026-04")
      - Each month contains category names with orders/items/net_sales

   4) EXPENSE TRANSACTIONS (window.EXP_TXNS array)
      - Each entry: {ym, date, category, amount, explanation, employee, paid_from}
      - Append from PetPooja Expense Report detail rows

   After editing, just refresh your dashboard URL — changes appear immediately.
   No rebuild required.

   ============================================================================== */
